<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">OS-HGAdapter: Open Semantic Hypergraph Adapter for Large Language Models Assisted Entropy-Enhanced Image-Text Alignment</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Rongjun Chen
</span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
